 /* Size of bloom filter as multiple of 32 bits.
  * Has to be 4, 8, or 16.
  * Larger increases optimisation of style selection engine but uses more memory.
+ *
+ * 8 (VitaSurf): at 4 the filter an element inherits from its ancestors
+ * was a fifth full on a GitHub page, and the names every element shares
+ * -- html, body and their classes -- sat on the bits some rules need, so
+ * a rule like .prc-FormControl-LabelContainer-M-FSK > * was offered to
+ * every one of its 5,000 elements. At 8 the saved page offers a third
+ * fewer rules and selection runs 13 % fewer instructions; 16 gains
+ * nothing more. It costs 16 bytes per rule and per element.
  */
-#define CSS_BLOOM_SIZE 4
+#define CSS_BLOOM_SIZE 8
 
 
 
